{"2884930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Staring Time", "steam_appid": 2884930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > First Person Psychological Horror game  Inspired by the Surrealism of Layers Of Fear and Slender Man Monster Mechanics. Explore two dimensions simultaneously, solving puzzles to escape terrifying monsters in constantly evolving environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/329c5a83f4ed1c272d21a1e1018845b7.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/329c5a83f4ed1c272d21a1e1018845b7.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Trapped by a mysterious cult in Dark rooms full of dark forces. Your only way to stay sane is to Stare at Time. One Demon will want you to look at it, DON'T! The others are afraid of the Light. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the rituals of the cult? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/587525d870955b691ea30bb2e4de4b9f.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/587525d870955b691ea30bb2e4de4b9f.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=770 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on tense exploration in a dark surrealism nightmare. You are captured by a high society cult who force you into a dark ritual. Using the ancient cosmic device known as, &quot;The Timer&quot;, You are forced into a sleep paralysis induced astral projection by the hypnotizing sound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul falls into the layers of cosmic realities where the cult need you to meet their god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/fa58e589222f5dae92e4a316efff47d2.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/fa58e589222f5dae92e4a316efff47d2.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=770 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore the history of the undisclosed hidden Church on a farm land location which is the host of &quot;The Timer&quot;. Navigate between two dimensions through your astral form while trying to escape &quot;The Void&quot; and &quot;The Nether&quot;.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/e781b304a1929ecf8a7fb10b80f77125.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/e781b304a1929ecf8a7fb10b80f77125.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=772 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You navigate through distorted manifestations of reality and cross the veil by exploring the nether dimension in your astral form. Your soul chord will detach from your body if you don't find a way to reconnect to yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape the nightmare before you lose your soul !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/54a40f4783308767aac050957928a439.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/54a40f4783308767aac050957928a439.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=770 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  GAMEPLAY:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person walking simulator with a focus on tense exploration and environmental puzzle solving. You have to crouch through tight spaces and overcome challenging obstacle courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/24960c482683c79bb830830e5b12ef11.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/24960c482683c79bb830830e5b12ef11.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/fb9f99c31a445a478db98c83a10bbf7f.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/fb9f99c31a445a478db98c83a10bbf7f.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a flashlight you switch dimensions instantly and can explore multiple realities at the same time. In the void there is only darkness and time is frozen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In the Nether, you are experiencing the dimension below the astral layer, where cosmic evil bends reality to their will and trapping human souls to serve them as gods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/667ac25f4436438b0948149705019824.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/667ac25f4436438b0948149705019824.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/81661635a779b5a33ab4e76d0ed0970f.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/81661635a779b5a33ab4e76d0ed0970f.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Environment is constantly evolving as you progress through multidimensional levels while exploring the void and the nether simultaneously. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you take too long to find the right clock or solve the puzzles in time, dangerous monsters will hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/c4f18493edea0f0b808a88b073068744.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/c4f18493edea0f0b808a88b073068744.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment through puzzle solving challenges, search keys for locked doors and use various items to progress through mind bending puzzles and levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/5171ebb84194e6c6a4f65df85af7d416.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/5171ebb84194e6c6a4f65df85af7d416.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive a variety of enemies in both dimensions while trying to escape the terrifying red glowing stare of the interdimensional evil entity trying to steal your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/3e1487966e9a42b3cbeb0cbe6c3b60ad.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/3e1487966e9a42b3cbeb0cbe6c3b60ad.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the mystery of why this cult needs YOU to meet their god while trying to relink your soul back to your body before the &quot;The Timer&quot; runs out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/8fb3ea702d8b7246b844ff5b68d7df31.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/8fb3ea702d8b7246b844ff5b68d7df31.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Hours of tense horror gameplay, exploring 2 dimensions simultaneously. Using mysterious ancient mechanisms to relink your body to your soul and escape  dark evil entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > First Person Psychological Horror game  Inspired by the Surrealism of Layers Of Fear and Slender Man Monster Mechanics. Explore two dimensions simultaneously, solving puzzles to escape terrifying monsters in constantly evolving environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/329c5a83f4ed1c272d21a1e1018845b7.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/329c5a83f4ed1c272d21a1e1018845b7.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Trapped by a mysterious cult in Dark rooms full of dark forces. Your only way to stay sane is to Stare at Time. One Demon will want you to look at it, DON'T! The others are afraid of the Light. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the rituals of the cult? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/587525d870955b691ea30bb2e4de4b9f.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/587525d870955b691ea30bb2e4de4b9f.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=770 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on tense exploration in a dark surrealism nightmare. You are captured by a high society cult who force you into a dark ritual. Using the ancient cosmic device known as, &quot;The Timer&quot;, You are forced into a sleep paralysis induced astral projection by the hypnotizing sound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul falls into the layers of cosmic realities where the cult need you to meet their god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/fa58e589222f5dae92e4a316efff47d2.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/fa58e589222f5dae92e4a316efff47d2.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=770 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore the history of the undisclosed hidden Church on a farm land location which is the host of &quot;The Timer&quot;. Navigate between two dimensions through your astral form while trying to escape &quot;The Void&quot; and &quot;The Nether&quot;.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/e781b304a1929ecf8a7fb10b80f77125.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/e781b304a1929ecf8a7fb10b80f77125.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=772 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You navigate through distorted manifestations of reality and cross the veil by exploring the nether dimension in your astral form. Your soul chord will detach from your body if you don't find a way to reconnect to yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape the nightmare before you lose your soul !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/54a40f4783308767aac050957928a439.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/54a40f4783308767aac050957928a439.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=770 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  GAMEPLAY:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person walking simulator with a focus on tense exploration and environmental puzzle solving. You have to crouch through tight spaces and overcome challenging obstacle courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/24960c482683c79bb830830e5b12ef11.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/24960c482683c79bb830830e5b12ef11.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras/fb9f99c31a445a478db98c83a10bbf7f.avif?t=1786257650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884930/extras_big/fb9f99c31a445a478db98c83a10bbf7f.avif?t=1786257650 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a flashlight you switch dimensions instantly and can expl